cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this experimental project when reusing its code, data or documentation."
type: software
title: "Development and Experimental Calibration of an ESP32-Based Low-Pressure Monitoring System Using a U-Tube Manometer"
authors:
  - family-names: Przydzimirski
    given-names: Rafael Patrick
    website: "https://github.com/rafaelprzy"
abstract: "Educational ESP32-S3 and HX710B pressure acquisition platform calibrated against an approximate water U-tube reference, with reproducible base-R calibration and independent validation. Zero-offset variation and reference limitations are retained."
keywords:
  - pressure calibration
  - ESP32-S3
  - HX710B
  - biomedical instrumentation education
  - reproducible R analysis
